  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook for an additional 3 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken bouillon powder, paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5-6 minutes per side.",
    "Add the uncooked white rice, diced tomatoes, and chicken broth. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes, or until the rice is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "Remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
